{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yTzdHIBG3F1795131141.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國藥廠賽諾菲，據報正考慮收購美國藥企Insmed。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，賽諾菲已找來顧問，研究收購主攻肺病藥物研發的Insmed，如果交易落實，將成為2023年，輝瑞以430億美元收購Seagen以來，最大宗藥企併購交易。</p><p></p><p>消息刺激Insmed股價急升兩成收市，市值增至接近317億美元。至於賽諾菲就跌近百分之3，市值約1,012億歐元，相當於約1,110億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.455049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:57:16.410877+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:17.118719+00:00","content_hash":"65db6cc8cee01c50696ce6aad46cb2354ccc2c7ce60b9d844a58cfcb4e59b3a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.455049+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}